{"summary":"Examine the dioramas of your life, and uncover the truth about your death","description":"Trapped between life and death, frightened and alone, you must unravel the dark and poignant truth that led to your fate. Dig beneath the beautifully rendered façades and interiors of an ordinary suburban lifestyle to discover a breathtaking tale crafted by an award-winning author.\n\nPiece together this compelling story by revealing objects and memories, decipher these clues and reveal more of the story and its dark secrets. From your own home to eerily deserted streets, beautiful apartment blocks to sinister abandoned hospitals, you must search forensically for clues. Each new reveal takes you closer to the life you once had, to the people and places that surrounded you, in your seemingly carefree childhood. Why are you here? Why are you trapped? Will you ever get home?\n\n- Experience a stunningly immersive story written by award-winning author Joost Vandecasteele\n\n- Explore every nook and cranny of each beautifully rendered diorama\n\n- Play through five compelling chapters, with each revealing more secrets and twists that will lead you to the truth\n\n- From an unassuming sitting room, to a tent in a forest, from a police car in a tree to an abandoned hospital, a seemingly innocent suburbia is yours to discover","esrbNotes":"Alcohol Reference, Language, Mild Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Swearing","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8r3IyR1FdfQ?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/L-WdBt01rXmbagR2W5-ZamTXl-STfkdJQF2bJAmwBgRt0VWIK-9AYrcKm_-qq8OqTfPgfVNJEkHM6vi364k3","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yZ1S4l5V9LOPMyxU1thIJYE6QKl0JsbQXfW1ka596vqdMUPW6C-k9m5Omgg2UETSF4X-Eub9oL-KPU-dJUbyVA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yDTdFJ3U_9BUZcsVn0u_9ENxmvjGaRevUtO7sK3Px4wa8Qky3Kq3rVQC9lF6yUYoaXtwlpVNk3DTxzbrNd-HcTg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eMdFGuDG-AXLPvQN-oZpQVNjk